<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Obey! (Obey!) Obey! (Obey!)</l><l>Obey our folks today. (today)</l><l>When we say, “Amen!” we honor them,</l><l>Let’s cheerfully obey!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
